I wake up in my bed.
Last night, the first rain fell in Mumbai.
Now there is no intense heat in the city.
Today in the morning, the weather is cool.
But today I am not well.
I am very sick.
There is a fever in my body.
There is a heavy pain in my head.
My nose is blocked.
There is pain in my throat as well.
I try to get up.
But there is no strength in my body.
This is my first illness in Mumbai.
Because of the change of season, my health is not fine.
I go slowly to the kitchen.
There I drink warm water.
Today I cannot go to the office.
I should only rest today.
Now I want to talk with a doctor.
